<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Protect the Earth Poster</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Chalkboard SE', 'Marker Felt', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .poster {
            background-color: #fff;
            width: 800px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            position: relative;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .header {
            position: relative;
            height: 160px;
        }
        .title-protect {
            font-size: 75px;
            color: #a4c2f4;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #2952a3;
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            left: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .title-earth {
            font-size: 65px;
            color: #a4c2f4;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #2952a3;
            position: absolute;
            top: 70px;
            left: 340px;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .author {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 20px;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .middle {
            position: relative;
            height: 550px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .circle-drawing {
            width: 450px;
            height: 450px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px dashed #888;
            position: absolute;
            top: 50px;
            left: 175px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #555;
            font-style: italic;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .annotation {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 22px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .anno-tl {
            top: 10px;
            left: 10px;
            width: 280px;
        }
        .anno-tr {
            top: 30px;
            right: 10px;
            width: 250px;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .anno-bl {
            bottom: 60px;
            left: 30px;
            width: 250px;
        }
        .anno-br {
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 10px;
            width: 280px;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 55px;
            color: #b6d7a8;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 2px #38761d;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 10px 0 30px 0;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }
        .rules {
            width: 65%;
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .rules p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .rule-indent {
            display: block;
            margin-left: 220px;
        }
        .earth-tap-drawing {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            border: 2px dashed #888;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #555;
            font-style: italic;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin-top: -20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="poster">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 class="title-protect">Protect</h1>
            <h1 class="title-earth">the Earth</h1>
            <div class="author">
                顾译文<br>
                六(2)班
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="middle">
            <div class="annotation anno-tl">
                Smoke from cars makes<br>
                <span style="margin-left: 100px;">the air dirty.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="annotation anno-tr">
                Too much plastic is bad<br>
                for the Earth.
            </div>

            <div class="circle-drawing placeholder">
                [Diagram: Circular drawing divided into 4 quadrants showing pollution (cars, plastic, rubbish, cut trees) vs clean environment]
            </div>

            <div class="annotation anno-bl">
                Rubbish makes the<br>
                <span style="margin-left: 40px;">park messy and dirty.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="annotation anno-br">
                Trees help keep the<br>
                air clean.<br>
                We should not cut down<br>
                too many trees.
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="subtitle">Let's protect our Earth!</h2>

        <div class="bottom">
            <div class="rules">
                <p>1. We should not waste water.</p>
                <p>2. We should reuse and save water.</p>
                <p>3. There is not much coal or oil on Earth.<br>
                   <span class="rule-indent">We should save energy.</span></p>
                <p>4. We should use paper bags and glass bottles.</p>
                <p>5. We should put rubbish in the bin.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="earth-tap-drawing placeholder">
                [Diagram: Earth with a leaking water tap filling a puddle]
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
